  "Plan production around market prices and the extension officer’s advice.": "Panga uzalishaji kulingana na bei za soko na ushauri wa afisa ugani.",
  "Buy good-quality certified seed from a trusted source.": "Nunua mbegu bora zilizothibitishwa kutoka chanzo unachokiamini.",
  "Clear and level the field; dig channels to bring water in and drain it out.": "Safisha na sawazisha shamba; chimba mifereji ya kuingiza na kutoa maji.",
  "Build nursery beds 120–160 cm wide, 30–50 cm wide at the top, and 40–50 cm deep.": "Tengeneza vitanda vya kitalu vyenye upana wa sm 120–160, upana wa juu sm 30–50, na kina cha sm 40–50.",
  "Transplant seedlings aged 14–21 days at 20 cm spacing, 1–3 seedlings per hill.": "Pandikiza miche yenye umri wa siku 14–21 kwa nafasi ya sm 20, miche 1–3 kwa shina.",
