  "Replant gaps where seedlings died, within 10 days of transplanting.": "Panda tena mahali miche ilipokufa, ndani ya siku 10 baada ya kupandikiza.",
  "Weed first and keep water no deeper than 5 cm, then apply top-dressing fertilizer 14 days after transplanting, as the extension officer advises.": "Palilia kwanza na weka maji yasizidi kina cha sm 5, kisha weka mbolea ya kukuzia siku 14 baada ya kupandikiza, kama afisa ugani anavyoshauri.",
  "Remove weeds and keep the water no deeper than 15 cm.": "Ondoa magugu na weka maji yasizidi kina cha sm 15.",
  "Inspect the field for pests and diseases; if you use pesticide, follow the label rate or the extension officer’s advice.": "Kagua shamba kwa wadudu na magonjwa; ukitumia kiuatilifu, fuata kipimo cha kwenye lebo au ushauri wa afisa ugani.",
  "Never leave pesticide containers in the field; collect them and store or dispose of them safely after use.": "Usiache kamwe vyombo vya viuatilifu shambani; vikusanye na uvihifadhi au uviteketeze kwa usalama baada ya kutumia.",
  "Apply the grain-filling fertilizer at the right rate and keep watching for pests.": "Weka mbolea ya kujaza punje kwa kiwango sahihi na endelea kuchunguza wadudu.",
  "Make sure no pesticide containers have been left in the field during the March follow-up.": "Hakikisha hakuna vyombo vya viuatilifu vilivyoachwa shambani wakati wa ufuatiliaji wa Machi.",
  "April–May: make sure all pesticide containers have been removed from the field before harvest preparation.": "Aprili–Mei: hakikisha vyombo vyote vya viuatilifu vimeondolewa shambani kabla ya maandalizi ya kuvuna.",
